---
import { v9Href } from '~/data/v9/routes';
---

<!-- Handoff industries/banking-financial-services.html: roles. Native Astro markup; shared document shell is V9Layout. -->
<section class="g-dark" id="roles">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-v9-reveal><span class="tick">\</span> 04 · Roles and interviewers</div>
    <h2 style="--d:60ms" data-v9-reveal>Every level, one guarantee.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="--d:120ms" data-v9-reveal>
      If none of the three fit, we search again at no extra cost. That holds for a payments engineer and for a CFO. Each
      interview is run by someone who has held the job, on ground they’ve worked.
    </p>
    <div class="ix-rb">
      <ul class="ix-roles">
        <li style="--d:0ms" data-v9-reveal><b>Engineering &amp; technology</b><span>Mid to senior</span></li><li
          style="--d:40ms"
          data-v9-reveal
        >
          <b>Risk &amp; compliance</b><span>Analyst to VP</span>
        </li><li style="--d:80ms" data-v9-reveal><b>Product management</b><span>PM to group PM</span></li><li
          style="--d:120ms"
          data-v9-reveal
        >
          <b>Data &amp; analytics</b><span>Analyst to head of data</span>
        </li><li style="--d:160ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <b>Investment &amp; wealth</b><span>Associate to director</span>
        </li><li style="--d:200ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <b>Operations &amp; process</b><span>Lead to COO</span>
        </li><li style="--d:240ms" data-v9-reveal><b>Fintech &amp; payments</b><span>IC to platform lead</span></li><li
          style="--d:280ms"
          data-v9-reveal
        >
          <b>Finance &amp; FP&amp;A</b><span>Manager to CFO</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="ix-bench" style="--d:120ms" data-v9-reveal>
        <span class="ql">On our banking bench</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Risk and compliance leads, 13–15 yrs</li><li>Capital markets, 12 yrs</li><li>
            Core banking and payments engineering, 11 yrs
          </li><li>Finance transformation, 15 yrs</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="ql">What that changes</span>
        <ul class="ix-chg">
          <li>The follow-up lands, because they know where answers usually thin out.</li><li>
            Titles get read against what the person was accountable for.
          </li><li>A weak answer gets a second chance before it gets a low score.</li><li>
            The write-up is in the language your hiring manager already uses.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ix-miss-r" data-v9-reveal>
      Not seeing your role? <a
        class="link"
        href={v9Href('/__v9/contact?sector=banking-financial-services', Astro.url.pathname)}
        >Tell us what you’re hiring for ›</a
      > We’ll say straight away whether it’s our ground.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
